<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hello<span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(15, 7, 255);">&nbsp;</span>{!Contact.FirstName},</p><p style="color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; font-size: 14px; box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Thank you for contacting Insperity Time &amp; Attendance Support. For security purposes, we require answers to the following questions for each non-Insperity user prior to an account being created for them:</span></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><ul><li><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Employee’s name and email address</span></font></li><li><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Country where employee lives and will be working</span></font></li><li><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">If in the United States, please also provide their state</span></font></li><li><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Will this user be tracking their own time and/or accruals in the system?</span></font></li><li><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Will this user be supervising other employees?</span></font></li><li><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Will this user be processing approvals and/or payroll?</span></font></li></ul></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Even if some of this information was in your original email, please reply to this message with answers to the above questions for each non-Insperity user. This will allow us to direct the information to the appropriate group and provide guidance in the most timely manner possible.</span></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;"><br></span></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Thank you in advance,</span></font></p><p style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#181818" face="-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, Apple Color Emoji, Segoe UI Emoji, Segoe UI Symbol"><span style="font-size: 14px;">Insperity Time &amp; Attendance Technical Support Team</span></font></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>